# Local Pi runtime state
.atl/

# Nix build results
result
result-*

# OrcaSlicer writes this report into the current working directory on exit, so
# it lands at the repository root whenever the slicer is launched from there.
# Anchored to the root on purpose: `result` and `result-*` above are unanchored
# because they come from `nix build`, but a bare `result.json` would also hide a
# legitimate file of that name anywhere in the tree.
/result.json
